{
  'slug': 'adidas-bape-crazy-energy-november-7',
  'title': 'Adidas and BAPE set November 7 launch for Crazy Energy+ collaboration',
  'category': 'Release Dates',
  'date': '2026-11-07',
  'publish': '2026-11-07T12:20:00+00:00',
  'description': 'The latest adidas and BAPE collection pairs the Crazy Energy+ basketball shoe with apparel inspired by late-1990s and early-2000s basketball culture.',
  'image': '/assets/news/adidas-bape-crazy-energy-november-7.jpg',
  'image_alt': 'Flat lay of three pairs of pastel unbranded sneakers',
  'body': '<p>Adidas and streetwear label BAPE are releasing a new collaborative collection on November 7, including a BAPE take on adidas\' Crazy Energy+ basketball shoe. (<a href="https://news.adidas.com/termsconditions/basketball/adidas-and-bape--reunite-for-a-collection-inspired-by-the-basketball-golden-era-of-the-late--90s-and/s/f55e632a-3fc8-4133-9990-e92f7b2f40ef">source</a>)</p>\n<p>Adidas said the collection draws inspiration from basketball culture and streetwear in the late 1990s and early 2000s. The collaboration combines a performance basketball silhouette with apparel and accessories featuring BAPE\'s recognisable design language.</p>\n<p>The apparel range includes a varsity jacket with purple accents and a chenille back graphic, a reversible camouflage hoodie, track pants, a warm-up top, a BABY MILO T-shirt, a beanie and a basketball bag.</p>\n<p>The brand\'s announcement says the collection will be available through the adidas CONFIRMED app, selected retailers, BAPE stores and BAPE\'s website. Adidas\' release announcement confirms the November 7 date but does not provide a single universal launch time or price for every item.</p>\n<p>Just Drops lists the Crazy Energy+ BAPE shoe among the day\'s scheduled sneaker releases, with a reported retail price of $200. Buyers should check adidas and participating retailers for current stock, sizing and checkout details.</p>\n<p>The release adds another basketball-focused collaboration to the brands\' shared catalogue, with the shoe and clothing range aimed at fans of both performance footwear and streetwear.</p>',
  'sources': [('https://news.adidas.com/termsconditions/basketball/adidas-and-bape--reunite-for-a-collection-inspired-by-the-basketball-golden-era-of-the-late--90s-and/s/f55e632a-3fc8-4133-9990-e92f7b2f40ef', 'https://news.adidas.com/termsconditions/basketball/adidas-and-bape--reunite-for-a-collection-inspired-by-the-basketball-golden-era-of-the-late--90s-and/s/f55e632a-3fc8-4133-9990-e92f7b2f40ef', '', '2026-11-07'), ('https://justdrops.com/today', 'https://justdrops.com/today', '', '2026-11-07')],
},

